Note try and catch, in words end note.
Try,
  Set x to 5 divided by 0.
  Say x.
if something goes wrong,
  Say text That did not work. The problem was, end text, the problem.
end try.
Try,
  Make a list called short list holding 1, 2, 3.
  Say item 9 of short list.
if something goes wrong,
  Say text Caught again. end text
  Say text The problem was, end text, the problem.
end try.
Say text All done, and the program kept going. end text
